ay without controllers. Lean to turn and stand up to jump using intuitive body movements.\nAvoid obstacles, jump onto rails, and pull off grinds as you ski farther with every run.\n\n# \ud83d\udd25 Key Features:\n**\ud83c\udfbf Controller-Free Body Controls:**\nPlay without controllers\u2014lean left or right to turn and stand up to jump.\n\n**\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Endless Skiing:**\nKeep moving down the mountain and see how far you can go.\n\n**\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f Rail Grinds:**\nJump onto rails and pull off grinds to boost your score.\n\n**\ud83c\udf05 Changing Snowy Scenery:**\nWatch the snowy scenery change from morning through afternoon, sunset, and night.\n\n**\ud83c\udfc6 High-Score Challenge:**\nTrack your distance, airtime, grinds, and near misses. Try again and beat your best score!\n\nReady to hit the slopes? No controllers needed\u2014just start skiing! \u2744\ufe0f\n", "short_description": "Endless VR skiing with intuitive body controls\u2014no controllers needed. Lean to turn and stand up to jump! \u2744\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/product/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "290439171